            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tripos"} triposes
          %p
            A preliminary technical task is to encode pairing and unpairing functions by elements of
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
